THIRD-PARTY NOTICES

src/components/chart.tsx is adapted from the shadcn/ui chart kit
(https://ui.shadcn.com), Copyright (c) 2023 shadcn, MIT licensed. The structure
— config-driven series colours injected as CSS custom properties, the muted
axis/grid treatment, and the tooltip/legend content components — is retained;
it has been ported to Recharts 3 and re-skinned onto this package's own tokens
rather than shadcn's.
